.TH LUXAFOR-TOGGLE 1 "" "luxafor-status" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
luxafor-toggle \- set or cycle the status shown by a Luxafor light
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B luxafor-toggle
.RI [ id " | " off ]
.br
.B luxafor-toggle
.I id
.B \-\-for
.I duration
.br
.B luxafor-toggle
.RB [ \-\-timer " | " \-\-cancel\-timer " | " \-\-list " | " \-\-settings " | " \-\-current " | " \-\-edit " | " \-\-reload ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Without arguments,
.B luxafor-toggle
moves to the next status, in the order of the configuration file, then off.
With a status
.IR id ,
it sets that status. A desktop notification shows the new status.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-for " duration"
Set the status for a while, then go back to the default status.
.I duration
is in minutes
.RB ( 30 ),
or written as
.BR 45m ", " 1h ", " 1h30
(at most 24 hours). Setting a status without
.B \-\-for
cancels a running timer; a call detected by
.BR luxafor-callwatch (1)
does not.
.TP
.B \-\-timer
Show the running timer and the time left.
.TP
.B \-\-cancel\-timer
Stop the timer and keep the current status.
.TP
.B \-\-settings
Show the settings in use.
.TP
.B \-\-list
List the configured statuses.
.TP
.B \-\-current
Print the id of the current status.
.TP
.B \-\-edit
Open the status configuration in an editor (created from the defaults
if needed).
.TP
.B \-\-reload
Regenerate the status icons and the launcher's right-click actions after
editing the configuration by hand.
.SH CONFIGURATION
One status per line, as
.IR "id " | " color " | " label" :
.PP
.nf
.RS
available | green   | Available
busy      | red     | Busy
focus     | #0000ff | Focus \(em do not disturb
.RE
.fi
.PP
.I id
uses lowercase letters, digits,
.BR \- " and " _ ;
.B off
is reserved.
.I color
is anything
.BR luxafor-light (1)
accepts.
.I label
is shown in menus and notifications.
.PP
Settings are
.IR "key " = " value"
lines in the same file:
.TP
.B default-status
Status a timer goes back to (default:
.BR available ,
or the first status).
.TP
.B call-status
Status used during calls by
.BR luxafor-callwatch (1)
(default:
.BR call ).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/luxafor-status/statuses.conf
Your statuses.
.TP
.I /usr/share/luxafor-status/statuses.conf
Default statuses, used when you have none.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/luxafor-state
The current status.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/luxafor-timer
The running timer.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR luxafor-light (1),
.BR luxafor-tray (1)
